1.14.5 Release notes (2026-11-13)
================================

Improvements to the 'RingPublishingTracking' module.

### Changes

* 'OfferContextData.source' is nullable, as in the iOS SDK
    - a paid event without a source no longer sends an empty 'source', it leaves the parameter out
    - the PaidEvent schema types 'source' as string or null
